+    "removeAllInteractionsAuthoredByLocalUser(thread: TSGroupThread, tx: DBWriteTransaction)": |
+      Removes only the interactions in `thread` that the local user sent, leaving every other
+      participant's interactions untouched. Notifies linked devices of the deleted messages so
+      the deletion is reflected there too.
+
+      Algorithm:
+      1. Batch-fetch the local user's outgoing messages in `thread`, newest first.
+      2. Delete each batch per `soft_delete_by_default`, notifying linked devices per batch.
+      3. Recompute (rather than reset) the thread's last-interaction/last-visible pointers from
+         what remains, since other participants' interactions may still exist.
 
